<title>BOSNIA: SFOR provides helicopters for Albanian rescue.</title>
<headline>SFOR provides helicopters for Albanian rescue.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The NATO-led peacekeeping force in Bosnia turned over some helicopters to countries which provided them so that they could be used to evacuate foreigners from Albania, a spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Stabilisation Force (SFOR) was not involved itself in the evacuation.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the United States, Britain, France, Germany and Italy requested the return of their helicopters for the operation.</p>
<p>SFOR expected the return of the aircraft when the evacuation was complete.</p>
</text>
